From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt7601u: feed EXTRA_CFLAGS into kbuild

Linux 7.3 no longer consumes EXTRA_CFLAGS. Pass the driver
defines and include paths through subdir-ccflags-y.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/Makefile	2026-11-02 12:32:21.059217257 -0500
+++ b/Makefile	2026-11-02 12:32:21.078203843 -0500
@@ -158,3 +158,5 @@
 
 clean:
 	$(MAKE) -C $(KSRC) M=$(PWD) clean
+
+subdir-ccflags-y += $(EXTRA_CFLAGS)
